  "name": null,
  "problem": "The graph of $y=3f(5x-15),$ can be obtained from the graph of $y=f(x)$ by applying **some** of the following transformations:\n\n- $(\\text{T}1)$ - Stretch by a scale factor of $3$ parallel to the $y$-axis\n\n- $(\\text{T}2)$ - Stretch by a scale factor of $0.2$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\n- $(\\text{T}3)$ - Stretch by a scale factor of $5$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\n- $(\\text{T}4)$ - Translate right by $3$ units\n\nWhich of the following could be a possible ordering of the appropriate transformations?",
